1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:04,676
One fry. On the floor. And nobody noticed.

2
00:00:09,299 --> 00:00:12,043
...except one very hungry seagull.

3
00:00:17,199 --> 00:00:22,416
Dive. Lock on. And when the world slows down... find the rhythm.

4
00:00:26,299 --> 00:00:29,787
Hold Tab. Everything that glows is a fry.

5
00:00:30,249 --> 00:00:33,426
Coffee. A cocktail. Ice cream.

6
00:00:33,320 --> 00:00:37,000
All three at once... and the wind turns to colour.

7
00:00:54,604 --> 00:00:56,676
Catch a fish.

8
00:01:00,672 --> 00:01:02,744
Catch a rainbow.

9
00:01:06,140 --> 00:01:08,212
Catch a falling star.

10
00:01:54,632 --> 00:01:56,704
Just some fries.

